OL,3,GNEWSAWW1 soldier's family found after
OL,4,Amedal mystery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mystery medal belonging to a soldier
OL,7,Fwho was killed in World War One is set
OL,8,Fto be handed over to his family.
OL,10,FJoyce Smith found the medal, assigned
OL,11,Fto Private Joseph Newbury, from The
OL,12,FSherwood Foresters (Nottinghamshire and
OL,13,FDerbyshire Regiment), among her late
OL,14,Fhusband's collection at her home in
OL,15,FBolton and appealed for help to find
OL,16,Frelatives of the soldier.
OL,18,FHistorian Andy Bye got in touch and
OL,19,Ftracked down the great granddaughters
OL,20,Fof Pte Newbury, from Derby, after
OL,21,Ffinding his military records.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
